//! CPU-only official1017 Engram token normalization, fixed hash geometry and lane history.
//! This is not an Engram weight lookup, projection, GPU kernel or serving backend.
//!
//! Ported from DeepSeek `inference/engram.py` at revision
//! `1bae0e1088993b9b82de08f59de5be5a34e42170`, SHA256
//! `11f35ecbead8150c35aa002b3d180ef290b05a25afe883a11884f94d476d3897`.
//! PCG64 multipliers and prime buckets are generated by that exact Python/NumPy CPU oracle;
//! no replacement RNG or guessed hash constants are used here.
